{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118403","id":3516893919,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Rn4rf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118403","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118403.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118403.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118403","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118403/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118403/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118403/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/95f1020f7f3beb3a9307872e29adcaca24441523","number":118403,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add new icon_size field to CheckBox Control Nodes.","user":{"login":"brendevr","id":178747313,"node_id":"U_kgDOCqd3sQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178747313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr","html_url":"https://github.com/brendevr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brendevr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds a new theme constant for `CheckBox` `Control` `Node`s that allows the theme to specify a specific size for the `CheckBox` icon.\r\nThis solves the problem of having to scale the image file itself, and also allows multiple `CheckBox` `Control` `Node`s to use the same image texture at different sizes.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new constant in `default_theme.cpp`, \"icon_size\" to the `CheckBox`. It then binds that constant to the `Theme`.\r\nFor behavior, I have it detect at two different locations if the `icon_size` is greater than zero.\r\nIn `get_icon_size` there is a check, with an early `return` that simply returns a `Size2` with `x` and `y` set to the `icon_size`.\r\nIn the draw notification code block, I changed the `tex->draw_rect()` call to again check if `icon_size` is greater than zero. If it is, then I just call `get_icon_size()`. If it isn't, simply use the old draw behavior.\r\n\r\nScreenshot of the theme constant in effect:\r\n<img width=\"421\" height=\"440\" alt=\"screenshot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0f9d7f0-9122-4a93-9c23-05513deade3b\" />\r\nEach one has a smaller `icon_size` constant override, with the bottom-most one being set to zero, so that it uses the size of the source image.\r\n\r\nI wasn't sure if I should keep it local to `CheckBox` or somehow generalize it to `Button` or copy the behavior to other `Button` types, so I just kept it local for now.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/mileston